**What was done**

- `server/session/vtt.ts` — `srtToVtt`: pure line transform (` --> ` lines get `,` → `.`, everything else passes through byte-for-byte); `WEBVTT\n` for empty input, `WEBVTT\n\n` + body otherwise.
- `server/session/routes.ts` — `exportQuerySchema` + `GET /api/sessions/:id/export` with the pinned handler: session resolves first (404), then `format` validates via `z.literal('vtt')` (400 via `ZodError`), responds `text/vtt` + `Content-Disposition: attachment; filename="<id>.vtt"`.
- `server/session/vtt.test.ts` — 4 unit cases (bilingual cues, single-line cue, commas in text untouched, empty input).
- `server/app.test.ts` — `describe('session export')` with fixture seeding `.md` + `.srt` into the `<dir>/<YYYY-MM-DD>/` day subdirectory, covering happy path, 404, and both 400 cases.

**Verification**: `npm run typecheck` clean, `npm test` green — 17 files, 152 tests. No new dependencies, no storage/writer/web changes.

